SELECT 'Portland Japanese Garden','attraction','attraction','A 12.5-acre Japanese garden and cultural destination in Washington Park, with eight garden spaces, art, architecture and a Cultural Village.','One of Portland''s signature cultural experiences: a quiet, carefully composed hillside garden above the International Rose Test Garden.','Visitors to Portland, garden lovers, architecture and design enthusiasts, and anyone looking for a contemplative Washington Park stop.','Allow time to wander rather than rushing. The Garden is at 611 SW Kingston Ave in Washington Park, directly above the International Rose Test Garden.',45.5187,-122.7085,'611 SW Kingston Ave, Portland, OR 97205','US','United States','Oregon','Portland','Washington Park','97205','us-or-portland','America/Los_Angeles','Mon, Wed-Sun 10 AM-5:30 PM; Tue 12 PM-5:30 PM','approved','Oleksandr Dmytruk',CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,0,1,'roviq','trusted'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM places WHERE lower(name)='portland japanese garden');

